***REMOVED*** wowmin Secret — HTTP Basic Auth for the web service (WOWMIN_USERNAME /
***REMOVED*** WOWMIN_PASSWORD). Unmanaged mode: SOAP + MySQL creds are entered in the UI
***REMOVED*** and stored on the /data PVC, not in git.
***REMOVED***
***REMOVED***   cp wowmin-secret.yaml.example wowmin-secret.yaml
***REMOVED***   $EDITOR wowmin-secret.yaml   ***REMOVED*** set password
***REMOVED***   sops -e -i wowmin-secret.yaml
***REMOVED*** ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
apiVersion: v1
kind: Secret
metadata:
  name: wowmin
  namespace: wowmin
stringData:
  WOWMIN_USERNAME: bombom
  WOWMIN_PASSWORD: REPLACE_WITH_STRONG_PASSWORD
